+Configure Acme under the `acme` source key and send to `POST /hooks/acme`.
+It signs the exact body with HMAC-SHA256, supplied as a lowercase hexadecimal
+digest in `X-Acme-Signature`. Other sources use `X-Signature` with the same format.
+See [DEPLOY.md](DEPLOY.md) for the PostgreSQL retry rollout and pending-index upgrade.
+
 ```json
 { "github": { "secret": "dev-secret", "target": "http://localhost:4000/in", "retryDelaysMs": [1000, 2000, 5000, 10000] } }
 ```
diff --git a/migrations/003_pending_lookup.sql b/migrations/003_pending_lookup.sql
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..3f6810d
--- /dev/null
+++ b/migrations/003_pending_lookup.sql
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+-- Run outside a transaction: keep writes available while indexing existing rows.
+-- Also repairs older installations missing the index from the initial schema.
+CREATE INDEX CONCURRENTLY IF NOT EXISTS deliveries_pending
+  ON deliveries (available_at, id) WHERE status = 'pending';
+
+-- Refresh planner estimates after the production retry backfill.
+ANALYZE deliveries;
